{
  "title": "حركة القذيفة",
  "description": "دراسة حركة المقذوفات: مدى القذيفة، أقصى ارتفاع، معادلة المسار، تأثير السرعة الابتدائية والزاوية",
  "category": "الفيزياء",
  "category_id": 2,
  "unit_id": 2,
  "grade_level": "سنة ثالثة ثانوي",
  "order_index": 3,
  "is_free": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "مقدمة",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>حركة القذيفة هي حركة جسم في مجال الثقالة المنتظم، حيث يقذف بسرعة ابتدائية $\\vec{v}_0$ تميل بزاوية $\\alpha$ مع الأفقي. تتكون الحركة من مركبتين: أفقية (منتظمة) وشاقولية (متسارعة بانتظام).</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "I - المعادلات التفاضلية للحركة",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>نعتبر جسماً نقطياً $M$ كتلته $m$ يُقذف من نقطة $O$ بسرعة ابتدائية $\\vec{v}_0$ تصنع زاوية $\\alpha$ مع الأفقي. نهمل تأثير الهواء (الحركة في الفراغ). القوة الوحيدة المؤثرة هي الثقل $\\vec{P} = m\\vec{g}$.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>نختار معلماً متعامداً $(O, x, y, z)$ حيث $O$ نقطة الانطلاق، محور $(Ox)$ أفقي، محور $(Oz)$ شاقولي نحو الأعلى.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>بتطبيق قانون نيوتن الثاني $m\\vec{a} = m\\vec{g}$، نحصل على:</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "\\vec{a} = \\vec{g} \\quad \\text{أي} \\quad \\begin{cases} a_x = 0 \\\\ a_z = -g \\end{cases}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>بالمكاملة وباستعمال الشروط الابتدائية $\\vec{v}(0) = \\vec{v}_0$ و $\\vec{OM}(0) = \\vec{0}$، نجد:</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "\\vec{v}(t) : \\begin{cases} v_x(t) = v_0 \\cos\\alpha \\\\ v_z(t) = -g\\,t + v_0 \\sin\\alpha \\end{cases}"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "\\vec{OM}(t) : \\begin{cases} x(t) = (v_0 \\cos\\alpha)\\,t \\\\ z(t) = -\\frac{1}{2}g\\,t^2 + (v_0 \\sin\\alpha)\\,t \\end{cases}"
    },
    {
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "II - معادلة المسار",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>بحذف الزمن $t$ من المعادلتين (باستخدام $t = \\frac{x}{v_0 \\cos\\alpha}$)، نحصل على معادلة المسار:</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "z(x) = -\\frac{g}{2 v_0^2 \\cos^2\\alpha}\\,x^2 + \\tan\\alpha\\,x"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>المسار هو <strong>قطع مكافئ</strong> (Parabole)، يتجه نحو الأسفل. يخضع المسار لقانون $z(x) = -\\frac{x^2}{2p} + \\dots$.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "III - خصائص الحركة",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "1- زمن الصعود (الوصول إلى أقصى ارتفاع)",
      "level": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p>عند أقصى ارتفاع، تنعدم المركبة الشاقولية للسرعة ($v_z(t_s) = 0$):</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "t_s = \\frac{v_0 \\sin\\alpha}{g}"
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "variant": "tip",
      "text": "<strong>تفاعل مع المحاكاة:</strong> جرب تغيير المعايير المختلفة وشاهد تأثيرها على الحركة في الوقت الفعلي. استخدم أزرار التشغيل والإيقاف للتحكم في المحاكاة."
    },
    {
      "type": "simulation",
      "kind": "custom",
      "config": {
        "title": "محاكاة تفاعلية: حركة القذيفة",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 840
      },
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>محاكاة تفاعلية: حركة القذيفة</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{background:#0f172a;color:#e2e8f0;font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,sans-serif;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:20px;min-height:100vh}\n.container{max-width:1100px;width:100%}\nh1{text-align:center;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#fbbf24}\n.main-row{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}\ncanvas#mainCanvas{background:#0f172a;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;display:block}\n.sidebar{flex:1;min-width:280px;max-width:360px}\n.controls{background:#1e293b;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:10px;border:1px solid #334155}\n.ctrl-grid{display:grid;gap:8px}\n.ctrl-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.ctrl-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;flex:1;min-width:100px}\n.ctrl-group label{font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8}\n.ctrl-group .ctrl-val{font-size:11px;color:#fbbf24;margin-right:4px}\n.ctrl-group .ctrl-note{font-size:10px;color:#64748b}\ninput[type=range]{-webkit-appearance:none;width:100%;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:#334155;outline:none}\ninput[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb{-webkit-appearance:none;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=range]::-moz-range-thumb{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;cursor:pointer;border:none}\ninput[type=checkbox]{accent-color:#f59e0b;width:16px;height:16px;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle}\n.checkbox-label{font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;white-space:nowrap}\n.btn-row{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}\n.btn{background:#334155;color:#e2e8f0;border:none;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}\n.btn:hover{background:#475569}\n.btn-play{background:#3b82f6;color:#fff}\n.btn-play:hover{background:#2563eb}\n.btn-reset{background:#64748b;color:#fff}\n.btn-reset:hover{background:#475569}\n.btn-speed{background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:11px}\n.btn-speed.active{background:#f59e0b;color:#0f172a;border-color:#f59e0b}\n.data-panel{background:#1e293b;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #334155;margin-bottom:10px}\n.data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px}\n.data-table td{padding:2px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #0f172a}\n.data-table td.label{color:#94a3b8;white-space:nowrap}\n.data-table td.val{color:#e2e8f0;font-weight:700;direction:ltr;text-align:right;font-family:'Consolas','Courier New',monospace}\n.data-table tr.final td.label{color:#fbbf24}\n.graphs-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:10px}\n.graph-wrap{background:#1e293b;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #334155;text-align:center}\n.graph-wrap p{font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:4px}\n.graph-wrap canvas{background:#1e293b;border-radius:4px;display:block}\n@media(max-width:800px){.sidebar{max-width:100%}.ctrl-group{min-width:80px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<h1>محاكاة تفاعلية: حركة القذيفة</h1>\n\n<div class=\"main-row\">\n<canvas id=\"mainCanvas\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\"></canvas>\n\n<div class=\"sidebar\">\n<div class=\"controls\">\n<div class=\"ctrl-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"ctrl-row\">\n<div class=\"ctrl-group\">\n<label>زاوية القذف α <span class=\"ctrl-val\" id=\"alphaVal\">30</span>°</label>\n<input type=\"range\" id=\"alphaSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"89\" step=\"1\" value=\"30\" dir=\"ltr\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ctrl-group\">\n<label>السرعة الابتدائية v₀ <span class=\"ctrl-val\" id=\"v0Val\">20</span> m/s</label>\n<input type=\"range\" id=\"v0Slider\" min=\"5\" max=\"50\" step=\"1\" value=\"20\" dir=\"ltr\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"ctrl-group\">\n<label>ارتفاع القذف h₀ <span class=\"ctrl-val\" id=\"h0Val\">0.0</span> m</label>\n<input type=\"range\" id=\"h0Slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"0\" dir=\"ltr\">\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ctrl-row\">\n<div class=\"ctrl-group\" style=\"flex:0.8\">\n<label>شدة الجاذبية g <span class=\"ctrl-val\" id=\"gVal\">9.81</span> m/s²</label>\n<input type=\"range\" id=\"gSlider\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"9.81\" dir=\"ltr\">\n</div>\n<label class=\"checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"showVectors\" checked> إظهار الأشعة</label>\n<label class=\"checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"showTrail\" checked> إظهار المسار</label>\n<label class=\"checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"showCompare\"> مقارنة بزاوية 45°</label>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"btn-row\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-play\" id=\"playBtn\">▶ تشغيل</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-reset\" id=\"resetBtn\">↺ إعادة</button>\n<span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;margin-right:4px\">السرعة:</span>\n<button class=\"btn btn-speed\" data-speed=\"0.5\">0.5×</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-speed active\" data-speed=\"1\">1×</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-speed\" data-speed=\"2\">2×</button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-speed\" data-speed=\"5\">5×</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"data-panel\">\n<table class=\"data-table\">\n<tr><td class=\"label\">الزمن t (s)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dT\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">الموضع x (m)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dX\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">الموضع y (m)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dY\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">السرعة v (m/s)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dV\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">vx (m/s)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dVx\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">vy (m/s)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dVy\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"final\"><td class=\"label\">زمن الصعود ts (s)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dTs\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"final\"><td class=\"label\">أقصى ارتفاع H (m)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dH\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"final\"><td class=\"label\">المدى D (m)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dD\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"final\"><td class=\"label\">مدة الحركة T (s)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dTtotal\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">الطاقة الحركية Ec (J)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dEc\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">الطاقة الكامنة Ep (J)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dEp\">0.00</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"label\">الطاقة الميكانيكية Em (J)</td><td class=\"val\" id=\"dEm\">0.00</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"graphs-row\">\n<div class=\"graph-wrap\"><p>y(x) مسار الحركة</p><canvas id=\"graphYx\" width=\"330\" height=\"180\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"graph-wrap\"><p>الطاقة-الزمن Energy</p><canvas id=\"graphEnergy\" width=\"330\" height=\"180\"></canvas></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst MC_W = 700, MC_H = 400;\nconst GW = 330, GH = 180;\n\nconst mainC = document.getElementById('mainCanvas');\nconst ctx = mainC.getContext('2d');\nconst gyxC = document.getElementById('graphYx');\nconst gyxCtx = gyxC.getContext('2d');\nconst geC = document.getElementById('graphEnergy');\nconst geCtx = geC.getContext('2d');\n\nconst alphaSlider = document.getElementById('alphaSlider');\nconst alphaVal = document.getElementById('alphaVal');\nconst v0Slider = document.getElementById('v0Slider');\nconst v0Val = document.getElementById('v0Val');\nconst h0Slider = document.getElementById('h0Slider');\nconst h0Val = document.getElementById('h0Val');\nconst gSlider = document.getElementById('gSlider');\nconst gVal = document.getElementById('gVal');\nconst showVectorsCB = document.getElementById('showVectors');\nconst showTrailCB = document.getElementById('showTrail');\nconst showCompareCB = document.getElementById('showCompare');\nconst playBtn = document.getElementById('playBtn');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');\nconst speedBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.btn-speed');\n\nconst dT = document.getElementById('dT');\nconst dX = document.getElementById('dX');\nconst dY = document.getElementById('dY');\nconst dV = document.getElementById('dV');\nconst dVx = document.getElementById('dVx');\nconst dVy = document.getElementById('dVy');\nconst dTs = document.getElementById('dTs');\nconst dH = document.getElementById('dH');\nconst dD = document.getElementById('dD');\nconst dTtotal = document.getElementById('dTtotal');\nconst dEc = document.getElementById('dEc');\nconst dEp = document.getElementById('dEp');\nconst dEm = document.getElementById('dEm');\n\nlet paused = true;\nlet finished = false;\nlet speed = 1;\nlet simTime = 0;\nlet lastFrame = 0;\nlet MASS = 1;\n\nlet alpha = 30, v0 = 20, h0 = 0, g = 9.81;\nlet alphaRad = 0;\nlet v0x = 0, v0y = 0;\nlet ts = 0, H = 0, T = 0, D = 0;\nlet trajectory = [];\nlet energyData = [];\nlet compTrajectory = [];\nlet compEnergy = [];\n\nlet canvasScale = 1;\nlet originX = 0, originY = 0;\n\nfunction degToRad(d) { return d * Math.PI / 180; }\n\nfunction getParams() {\nreturn {\nalpha: parseFloat(alphaSlider.value),\nv0: parseFloat(v0Slider.value),\nh0: parseFloat(h0Slider.value),\ng: parseFloat(gSlider.value)\n};\n}\n\nfunction computeTrajectory(alphaDeg, v0, h0, g) {\nconst aRad = degToRad(alphaDeg);\nconst vx = v0 * Math.cos(aRad);\nconst vy = v0 * Math.sin(aRad);\nconst tS = vy / g;\nconst hMax = h0 + (vy * vy) / (2 * g);\nconst tTotal = (vy + Math.sqrt(vy * vy + 2 * g * h0)) / g;\nconst range = vx * tTotal;\n\nconst dt = 0.02;\nconst pts = [];\nconst ener = [];\nfor (let t = 0; t <= tTotal + dt; t += dt) {\nconst tt = Math.min(t, tTotal);\nconst x = vx * tt;\nconst y = -0.5 * g * tt * tt + vy * tt + h0;\nconst cy = Math.max(0, y);\nconst cvx = vx;\nconst cvy = -g * tt + vy;\npts.push({ t: tt, x, y, cy, vx: cvx, vy: cvy });\nconst ec = 0.5 * MASS * (cvx * cvx + cvy * cvy);\nconst ep = MASS * g * cy;\nconst em = ec + ep;\nener.push({ t: tt, ec, ep, em });\nif (y <= 0 && tt > 0) break;\n}\nreturn { points: pts, energy: ener, ts: tS, H: hMax, T: tTotal, D: range, v0x: vx, v0y: vy, alphaRad: aRad };\n}\n\nfunction computeAll() {\nconst p = getParams();\nalpha = p.alpha; v0 = p.v0; h0 = p.h0; g = p.g;\nconst main = computeTrajectory(alpha, v0, h0, g);\ntrajectory = main.points;\nenergyData = main.energy;\nalphaRad = main.alphaRad;\nv0x = main.v0x; v0y = main.v0y;\nts = main.ts; H = main.H; T = main.T; D = main.D;\n\nif (showCompareCB.checked) {\nconst comp = computeTrajectory(45, v0, h0, g);\ncompTrajectory = comp.points;\ncompEnergy = comp.energy;\n} else {\ncompTrajectory = [];\ncompEnergy = [];\n}\n}\n\nfunction computeCanvasTransform() {\nlet xMin = Infinity, xMax = -Infinity, yMin = Infinity, yMax = -Infinity;\nfor (const p of trajectory) {\nif (p.x < xMin) xMin = p.x;\nif (p.x > xMax) xMax = p.x;\nif (p.cy < yMin) yMin = p.cy;\nif (p.cy > yMax) yMax = p.cy;\n}\nif (xMax === xMin) { xMax = 1; xMin = 0; }\nif (yMax === yMin) { yMax = 1; yMin = 0; }\nif (compTrajectory.length) {\nfor (const p of compTrajectory) {\nif (p.x < xMin) xMin = p.x;\nif (p.x > xMax) xMax = p.x;\nif (p.cy < yMin) yMin = p.cy;\nif (p.cy > yMax) yMax = p.cy;\n}\n}\nconst pad = 0.2;\nconst xRng = xMax - xMin;\nconst yRng = yMax - yMin;\nconst xVisMin = xMin - pad * xRng;\nconst xVisMax = xMax + pad * xRng;\nconst yVisMin = Math.min(0, yMin - pad * yRng);\nconst yVisMax = yMax + pad * yRng;\nconst vw = xVisMax - xVisMin;\nconst vh = yVisMax - yVisMin;\nconst sX = MC_W / vw;\nconst sY = MC_H / vh;\ncanvasScale = Math.min(sX, sY);\noriginX = -xVisMin * canvasScale + (MC_W - vw * canvasScale) / 2;\noriginY = MC_H + yVisMin * canvasScale - (MC_H - vh * canvasScale) / 2;\n}\n\nfunction toCanvas(px, py) {\nreturn { x: originX + px * canvasScale, y: originY - py * canvasScale };\n}\n\nfunction drawGrid() {\nctx.strokeStyle = '#1e293b';\nctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\nfor (let cx = 0; cx <= MC_W; cx += 50) {\nctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(cx, 0); ctx.lineTo(cx, MC_H); ctx.stroke();\n}\nfor (let cy = 0; cy <= MC_H; cy += 50) {\nctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0, cy); ctx.lineTo(MC_W, cy); ctx.stroke();\n}\n}\n\nfunction drawAxes() {\nconst o = toCanvas(0, 0);\nctx.strokeStyle = '#94a3b8';\nctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(40, o.y);\nctx.lineTo(MC_W - 10, o.y);\nctx.stroke();\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(o.x, 10);\nctx.lineTo(o.x, MC_H - 20);\nctx.stroke();\nctx.fillStyle = '#94a3b8';\nctx.font = '11px sans-serif';\nctx.textAlign = 'left';\nctx.fillText('x (m)', MC_W - 10, o.y - 6);\nctx.textAlign = 'center';\nctx.fillText('y (m)', o.x - 6, 14);\n\nctx.font = '9px sans-serif';\nctx.fillStyle = '#64748b';\nctx.textAlign = 'center';\nconst nice = range => {const s=range/5;const m=Math.pow(10,Math.floor(Math.log10(s)));const r=s/m;const n=r<=1.5?1:r<=3.5?2:r<=7.5?5:10;return n*m};\nconst p1 = toCanvas(0,0);\nconst p2 = toCanvas(D,0);\nconst xStep = nice(D);\nconst xStart = Math.ceil(0/xStep)*xStep;\nfor (let v = xStart; v <= D+0.01; v += xStep) {\nconst p = toCanvas(v, 0);\nif (p.x > 20 && p.x < MC_W - 20 && Math.abs(p.y - p1.y) < 5) {\nctx.fillText(v.toFixed(v<1?1:0), p.x, p1.y + 14);\nctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(p.x, p1.y-3); ctx.lineTo(p.x, p1.y+3); ctx.strokeStyle='#64748b'; ctx.lineWidth=1; ctx.stroke();\n}\n}\nconst p3 = toCanvas(0,H);\nconst yStep = nice(H);\nconst yStart = Math.ceil(0/yStep)*yStep;\nfor (let v = yStart; v <= H+0.01; v += yStep) {\nconst p = toCanvas(0, v);\nif (p.y > 10 && p.y < MC_H - 20) {\nctx.fillText(v.toFixed(v<1?1:0), p.x - 12, p.y + 3);\nctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(p.x-3, p.y); ctx.lineTo(p.x+3, p.y); ctx.strokeStyle='#64748b'; ctx.lineWidth=1; ctx.stroke();\n}\n}\n}\n\nfunction drawTrajectoryPath(points, color, lineWidth, dash, maxT) {\nif (!points.length) return;\nctx.strokeStyle = color;\nctx.lineWidth = lineWidth;\nif (dash) ctx.setLineDash(dash);\nelse ctx.setLineDash([]);\nctx.beginPath();\nfor (let i = 0; i < points.length; i++) {\nconst p = points[i];\nif (maxT !== undefined && p.t > maxT) break;\nconst c = toCanvas(p.x, p.cy);\nif (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(c.x, c.y);\nelse ctx.lineTo(c.x, c.y);\n}\nctx.stroke();\nctx.setLineDash([]);\n}\n\nfunction drawTrajectoryDots(points, color, maxT) {\nif (!points.length) return;\nfor (let i = 0; i < points.length; i++) {\nconst p = points[i];\nif (maxT !== undefined && p.t > maxT) break;\nif (i % 5 !== 0) continue;\nconst c = toCanvas(p.x, p.cy);\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.arc(c.x, c.y, 2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\nctx.fillStyle = color;\nctx.fill();\n}\n}\n\nfunction getState(t) {\nif (t < 0) t = 0;\nif (t > T) t = T;\nconst x = v0x * t;\nconst y = -0.5 * g * t * t + v0y * t + h0;\nconst cy = Math.max(0, y);\nconst vvx = v0x;\nconst vvy = -g * t + v0y;\nreturn { x, y: cy, vx: vvx, vy: vvy };\n}\n\nfunction drawArrow(from, dx, dy, color, label, labelOff) {\nif (Math.abs(dx) < 1 && Math.abs(dy) < 1) return;\nconst len = Math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy);\nconst angle = Math.atan2(dy, dx);\nconst headLen = Math.min(8, len * 0.3);\nctx.save();\nctx.translate(from.x, from.y);\nctx.rotate(angle);\nctx.strokeStyle = color;\nctx.lineWidth = 2;\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(0, 0);\nctx.lineTo(len - headLen * 0.5, 0);\nctx.stroke();\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(len, 0);\nctx.lineTo(len - headLen, -headLen * 0.6);\nctx.lineTo(len - headLen, headLen * 0.6);\nctx.closePath();\nctx.fillStyle = color;\nctx.fill();\nif (label) {\nctx.fillStyle = color;\nctx.font = 'bold 11px sans-serif';\nctx.textAlign = 'center';\nctx.textBaseline = 'bottom';\nconst lo = labelOff || 14;\nctx.fillText(label, len / 2, -lo);\n}\nctx.restore();\n}\n\nfunction drawVectors(t) {\nif (!showVectorsCB.checked) return;\nconst s = getState(t);\nconst c = toCanvas(s.x, s.y);\nif (c.y < 0 || c.y > MC_H + 20) return;\nconst vecScale = Math.max(2, Math.min(6, canvasScale * 0.35));\nconst dx = s.vx * vecScale;\nconst dy = -s.vy * vecScale;\nconst colV = '#3b82f6';\nconst colVx = '#22c55e';\nconst colVy = '#f59e0b';\n\nconst tipVx = { x: c.x + dx, y: c.y };\ndrawArrow(c, dx, 0, colVx, 'vx', 14);\nconst fromVy = { x: c.x + dx, y: c.y };\ndrawArrow(fromVy, 0, dy, colVy, 'vy', 14);\ndrawArrow(c, dx, dy, colV, 'v', 16);\n}\n\nfunction drawAngleArc() {\nconst o = toCanvas(0, h0);\nconst radius = 35;\nctx.strokeStyle = '#a78bfa';\nctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.arc(o.x, o.y, radius, -alphaRad, 0, false);\nctx.stroke();\nctx.fillStyle = '#a78bfa';\nctx.font = '12px sans-serif';\nctx.textAlign = 'center';\nconst midAngle = -alphaRad / 2;\nctx.fillText('α', o.x + (radius + 18) * Math.cos(midAngle), o.y + (radius + 18) * Math.sin(midAngle) + 4);\n}\n\nfunction drawMarkers() {\nif (!trajectory.length) return;\nconst peak = toCanvas(v0x * ts, H);\nconst land = toCanvas(D, 0);\nctx.setLineDash([5, 5]);\nctx.strokeStyle = '#ef4444';\nctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(peak.x, peak.y);\nctx.lineTo(peak.x, toCanvas(0,0).y);\nctx.stroke();\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.moveTo(land.x, land.y);\nctx.lineTo(land.x, toCanvas(0,0).y);\nctx.stroke();\nctx.setLineDash([]);\nctx.fillStyle = '#ef4444';\nctx.font = 'bold 11px sans-serif';\nctx.textAlign = 'center';\nconst pLabY = toCanvas(0,0).y;\nctx.fillText('H_max = ' + H.toFixed(1) + ' m', peak.x, peak.y - 8);\nctx.fillText('D = ' + D.toFixed(1) + ' m', land.x, pLabY + 18);\nctx.fillStyle = '#fbbf24';\nctx.font = '10px sans-serif';\nctx.fillText('ذروة', peak.x, pLabY + 30);\nctx.fillText('مدى', land.x, pLabY + 30);\n}\n\nfunction drawProjectile(t) {\nconst s = getState(t);\nconst c = toCanvas(s.x, s.y);\nif (c.y < -20 || c.y > MC_H + 20) return;\nctx.beginPath();\nctx.arc(c.x, c.y, 6, 0, Math.PI * 2);\nctx.fillStyle = '#ef4444';\nctx.fill();\nctx.strokeStyle = '#dc2626';\nctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\nctx.stroke();\n}\n\nfunction drawCompareTrajectory() {\nif (!showCompareCB.checked || !compTrajectory.length) return;\ndrawTrajectoryPath(compTrajectory, '#64748b', 1.5, [4, 4]);\ndrawTrajectoryDots(compTrajectory, '#64748b');\nconst compLand = toCanvas(v0 * Math.cos(degToRad(45)) * compTrajectory[compTrajectory.length-1].t, 0);\nctx.fillStyle = '#64748b';\nctx.font = '10px sans-serif';\nctx.textAlign = 'center';\nctx.fillText('α=45°', compLand.x, compLand.y + 30);\n}\n\nfunction renderMain() {\nctx.clearRect(0, 0, MC_W, MC_H);\nctx.fillStyle = '#0f172a';\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, MC_W, MC_H);\n\nif (!trajectory.length) return;\ncomputeCanvasTransform();\ndrawGrid();\ndrawAxes();\ndrawCompareTrajectory();\n\nconst drawMax = finished ? undefined : simTime;\nif (showTrailCB.checked) {\ndrawTrajectoryPath(trajectory, '#f59e0b', 2, null, drawMax);\ndrawTrajectoryDots(trajectory, '#f59e0b', drawMax);\n}\ndrawMarkers();\ndrawAngleArc();\ndrawVectors(simTime);\ndrawProjectile(simTime);\n}\n\nfunction renderGraphYx() {\nconst c = gyxCtx;\nconst w = GW, h = GH;\nc.fillStyle = '#1e293b';\nc.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\nconst padL = 35, padR = 12, padT = 12, padB = 20;\nconst pw = w - padL - padR;\nconst ph = h - padT - padB;\n\nlet pts = trajectory;\nlet comp = showCompareCB.checked ? compTrajectory : null;\nif (!pts.length) return;\n\nlet xMin=Infinity,xMax=-Infinity,yMin=Infinity,yMax=-Infinity;\nfor (const p of pts) { if(p.x<xMin)xMin=p.x;if(p.x>xMax)xMax=p.x;if(p.cy<yMin)yMin=p.cy;if(p.cy>yMax)yMax=p.cy; }\nif (comp) { for (const p of comp) { if(p.x<xMin)xMin=p.x;if(p.x>xMax)xMax=p.x;if(p.cy<yMin)yMin=p.cy;if(p.cy>yMax)yMax=p.cy; } }\nconst xR=xMax-xMin||1, yR=yMax-yMin||1;\nconst pad2=0.1;\nconst x0=xMin-pad2*xR, x1=xMax+pad2*xR;\nconst y0=Math.min(0,yMin-pad2*yR), y1=yMax+pad2*yR;\nconst sx=pw/(x1-x0), sy=ph/(y1-y0);\nconst sc=Math.min(sx,sy);\nconst ox=padL+(pw-(x1-x0)*sc)/2 - x0*sc;\nconst oy=padT+(ph-(y1-y0)*sc)/2 + y1*sc;\nconst tc = (px,py) => ({x: ox + px*sc, y: oy - py*sc});\n\nc.strokeStyle = '#334155';\nc.lineWidth = 0.5;\nfor (let gx=0;gx<=w;gx+=25){c.beginPath();c.moveTo(gx,0);c.lineTo(gx,h);c.stroke()}\nfor (let gy=0;gy<=h;gy+=25){c.beginPath();c.moveTo(0,gy);c.lineTo(w,gy);c.stroke()}\n\nconst o=tc(0,0);\nc.strokeStyle='#64748b';c.lineWidth=1;\nc.beginPath();c.moveTo(padL,o.y);c.lineTo(w-padR,o.y);c.stroke();\nc.beginPath();c.moveTo(o.x,padT);c.lineTo(o.x,h-padB);c.stroke();\nc.fillStyle='#64748b';c.font='9px sans-serif';c.textAlign='left';c.fillText('x',w-padR,o.y-4);\nc.textAlign='center';c.fillText('y',o.x-6,padT+10);\n\nif (comp) {\nc.strokeStyle='#64748b';c.lineWidth=1;c.setLineDash([3,3]);\nc.beginPath();\nfor(let i=0;i<comp.length;i++){const p=tc(comp[i].x,comp[i].cy);if(i===0)c.moveTo(p.x,p.y);else c.lineTo(p.x,p.y)}\nc.stroke();c.setLineDash([]);\n}\n\nc.strokeStyle='#f59e0b';c.lineWidth=1.5;\nc.beginPath();\nfor(let i=0;i<pts.length;i++){const p=tc(pts[i].x,pts[i].cy);if(i===0)c.moveTo(p.x,p.y);else c.lineTo(p.x,p.y)}\nc.stroke();\n\nc.setLineDash([4,4]);c.strokeStyle='#ef4444';c.lineWidth=1;\nconst pk=tc(v0x*ts,H);\nconst ld=tc(D,0);\nc.beginPath();c.moveTo(pk.x,pk.y);c.lineTo(pk.x,o.y);c.stroke();\nc.beginPath();c.moveTo(ld.x,ld.y);c.lineTo(ld.x,o.y);c.stroke();\nc.setLineDash([]);\nc.fillStyle='#ef4444';c.font='8px sans-serif';c.textAlign='center';\nc.fillText('H='+H.toFixed(1),pk.x,pk.y-4);\nc.fillText('D='+D.toFixed(1),ld.x,o.y+12);\n}\n\nfunction renderGraphEnergy() {\nconst c = geCtx;\nconst w = GW, h = GH;\nc.fillStyle = '#1e293b';\nc.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\nconst padL = 35, padR = 8, padT = 12, padB = 18;\nconst pw = w - padL - padR;\nconst ph = h - padT - padB;\n\nconst data = energyData;\nif (!data.length) return;\n\nconst tMax = data[data.length-1].t || 1;\nlet eMax = 0;\nfor (const d of data) {\neMax = Math.max(eMax, d.ec, d.ep, d.em);\n}\neMax *= 1.15;\nif (eMax < 1) eMax = 1;\n\nc.strokeStyle = '#334155';\nc.lineWidth = 0.5;\nfor (let gx=0;gx<=w;gx+=25){c.beginPath();c.moveTo(gx,0);c.lineTo(gx,h);c.stroke()}\nfor (let gy=0;gy<=h;gy+=25){c.beginPath();c.moveTo(0,gy);c.lineTo(w,gy);c.stroke()}\n\nc.strokeStyle='#64748b';c.lineWidth=1;\nc.beginPath();c.moveTo(padL,padT);c.lineTo(padL,h-padB);c.stroke();\nc.beginPath();c.moveTo(padL,h-padB);c.lineTo(w-padR,h-padB);c.stroke();\nc.fillStyle='#64748b';c.font='9px sans-serif';c.textAlign='center';c.fillText('t (s)',padL+pw/2,h-2);\nc.save();c.translate(8,padT+ph/2);c.rotate(-Math.PI/2);c.fillText('E (J)',0,0);c.restore();\n\nfunction drawCurve(data, key, color, lineW) {\nc.strokeStyle = color; c.lineWidth = lineW || 1.5;\nc.beginPath();\nfor (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {\nconst x = padL + pw * (data[i].t / tMax);\nconst y = padT + ph * (1 - data[i][key] / eMax);\nif (i === 0) c.moveTo(x, y);\nelse c.lineTo(x, y);\n}\nc.stroke();\n}\ndrawCurve(data, 'ec', '#22c55e', 1.5);\ndrawCurve(data, 'ep', '#3b82f6', 1.5);\ndrawCurve(data, 'em', '#f59e0b', 1.5);\n\nc.font = '8px sans-serif';\nc.fillStyle='#22c55e';c.fillText('Ec',padL+pw-16,padT+10);\nc.fillStyle='#3b82f6';c.fillText('Ep',padL+pw-16,padT+20);\nc.fillStyle='#f59e0b';c.fillText('Em',padL+pw-16,padT+30);\n}\n\nfunction updateData(t) {\nconst s = getState(t);\nconst vMag = Math.sqrt(s.vx*s.vx + s.vy*s.vy);\ndT.textContent = t.toFixed(2);\ndX.textContent = s.x.toFixed(2);\ndY.textContent = s.y.toFixed(2);\ndV.textContent = vMag.toFixed(2);\ndVx.textContent = s.vx.toFixed(2);\ndVy.textContent = s.vy.toFixed(2);\ndTs.textContent = ts.toFixed(2);\ndH.textContent = H.toFixed(2);\ndD.textContent = D.toFixed(2);\ndTtotal.textContent = T.toFixed(2);\nconst ec = 0.5 * MASS * vMag * vMag;\nconst ep = MASS * g * s.y;\nconst em = ec + ep;\ndEc.textContent = ec.toFixed(2);\ndEp.textContent = ep.toFixed(2);\ndEm.textContent = em.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nfunction resetSim() {\nfinished = false;\nsimTime = 0;\npaused = true;\nplayBtn.textContent = '▶ تشغيل';\ncomputeAll();\nrenderMain();\nrenderGraphYx();\nrenderGraphEnergy();\nupdateData(0);\n}\n\nfunction stepPhysics(dt) {\nif (paused) return;\nif (finished) return;\nconst step = dt * speed;\nsimTime += step;\nif (simTime >= T) {\nsimTime = T;\nfinished = true;\npaused = true;\nplayBtn.textContent = '▶ تشغيل';\n}\nupdateData(simTime);\nrenderMain();\n}\n\nfunction loop(time) {\nif (!lastFrame) lastFrame = time;\nconst dt = Math.min((time - lastFrame) / 1000, 0.05);\nlastFrame = time;\nstepPhysics(dt);\nrequestAnimationFrame(loop);\n}\n\nfunction onParamChange() {\nresetSim();\n}\n\nalphaSlider.addEventListener('input', () => {\nalphaVal.textContent = alphaSlider.value;\nonParamChange();\n});\nv0Slider.addEventListener('input', () => {\nv0Val.textContent = v0Slider.value;\nonParamChange();\n});\nh0Slider.addEventListener('input', () => {\nh0Val.textContent = parseFloat(h0Slider.value).toFixed(1);\nonParamChange();\n});\ngSlider.addEventListener('input', () => {\ngVal.textContent = parseFloat(gSlider.value).toFixed(2);\nonParamChange();\n});\nshowVectorsCB.addEventListener('change', () => { if (paused) renderMain(); });\nshowTrailCB.addEventListener('change', () => { if (paused) renderMain(); });\nshowCompareCB.addEventListener('change', onParamChange);\n\nplayBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\nif (finished) { resetSim(); }\npaused = !paused;\nplayBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶ تشغيل' : '⏸ إيقاف';\nif (!paused) lastFrame = 0;\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', resetSim);\n\nspeedBtns.forEach(btn => {\nbtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\nspeedBtns.forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\nbtn.classList.add('active');\nspeed = parseFloat(btn.dataset.speed);\n});\n});\n\nresetSim();\nrequestAnimationFrame(loop);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "css": "",
